# Working notes, kept local. Narrowed from a bare `/docs` (86bbe4a), which ignored the whole
# tree: harmless for the ~50 todo files already tracked, because gitignore does not apply to
# tracked files, and silent for every *new* doc — a spec or an ADR written after that commit
# simply would not appear in `git status`. The rule keeps the working notes out and lets
# docs/superpowers/specs, docs/adr and lessons.md commit normally.
/docs/tasks/todo*.md

# Local data
.couchdb-data/
*.local

# Editors
.vscode/*
